<h3><u>Gham-e-hussain</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><b><u><font size=""4""><p>Gham-e-hussain</p>
</font></u></b><p><font size=""4"">Dekh kay giryao matam </font></p><font size=""4"">
<p>har aik farsh-e-aza per</p>
<p>duay karta hoon mola(a.s)</p>
<p>(jub talak hai yeh jahan) x2</p>
<p>hai dua meray khuda(j.j)</p>
<p>(Gham-e-Hussain rahe, ye azadar rahe) x2</p>
<ol><li>Jub talak hai yeh jahan, hai dua meray khuda(j.j)</li><p>(Gham-e-Hussain rahe, ye azadar rahe) x2</p><li>Teray huzoor dua mangtay hai ahl-e-aza</li><p>Kubool kar lay bahakay rasool(s.a.w) sub ki dua</p><p>Hamesha baki rahay zikr-e-shahenshahay wafa</p><p>Ay khuda(j.j) ay khuda(j.j)</p><p>Hum rahay ya na rahay rahay baki yeh sada</p><p>(Gham-e-Hussain rahe, ye azadar rahe) x4</p><li>Zamana laakh badalta rahay nigah magar</li><p>Dilon say mitnay nahi paye karbala ka asar</p><p>Azan kay saath karay matmi sada bhi safar</p><p>Ay khuda(j.j) ay khuda(j.j)</p><p>Jub chala zikr tera dil nay mangi yeh dua</p><p>(Gham-e-Hussain rahe, ye azadar rahe) x4</p><li>Yazedi fikr ko tu khaak may milata rahay</li><p>Faza may perchamay abbas(a.s) lahlahata rahay</p><p>Hussaini(a.s) azm yazeedon ka sar jhukata rahay</p><p>Ay khuda(j.j) ay khuda(j.j)</p><p>Sar jo sajday may gaya hum nay so baar kaha</p><p>(Gham-e-Hussain rahe, ye azadar rahe) x4</p><li>Ghamay hussain(a.s) ko mehfooz rakh jafaon say</li><p>Hussainiat(a.s) ka shajar door ho khizaon say</p><p>Saja diya hai musalay ko in duaon say</p><p>Ay khuda(j.j) ay khuda(j.j)</p><p>Lab kusha jub bhi huwa har hussaini(a.s) nay kaha</p><p>(Gham-e-Hussain rahe, ye azadar rahe) x4</p><li>Hamaray zakhmo ka marham hai yeh azay hussain(a.s)</li><p>Sub hi ibadatay kartay hai hum baray-e-hussain(a.s)</p><p>Labo pay taba qayamat sada ho haaye hussain(a.s)</p><p>Ay khuda(j.j) ay khuda(j.j)</p><p>In duao(n) may khuda(j.j) saath hai karbobala</p><p>(Gham-e-Hussain rahe, ye azadar rahe) x4</p><li>Rahay wafa may kabhi dagmaga na paye qadam</li><p>Hamaray dosh pay lehraye ba wafa ka alam</p><p>Hamaray azm say larza rahay yeh ahl-e-sitam</p><p>Ay khuda(j.j) ay khuda(j.j)</p><p>Jub bicha farsh-e-aza matmi kehnay laga</p><p>(Gham-e-Hussain rahe, ye azadar rahe) x4</p><li>Yeh majlise bhi khuda(j.j) madresoon say kam to nahi</li><p>Tera rasool bhi kehta hai sirf hum to nahi</p><p>Ghamay hussain(a.s) bara hai hamara ghum to nahi</p><p>Ay khuda(j.j) ay khuda(j.j)</p><p>Apnay ghum bhol gaya jis nay rokar yeh kaha</p><p>(Gham-e-Hussain rahe, ye azadar rahe) x4</p><li>Wikare majliso matam barhatay jayengay</li><p>Charagh ashk-e- aza jalatay jayengay</p><p>Hussaini(a.s) fikr dilo may jagatay jayengay</p><p>Ay khuda(j.j) ay khuda(j.j)</p><p>Jub kalam chalnay laga keh uthi fikr-e-rasa</p><p>(Gham-e-Hussain rahe, ye azadar rahe) x4</p><li>Yahi akeeda hai ""farhan"" aur ""mazhar"" ka</li></ol>

<p>Kay ek qabelay kay afrad hai yeh ahl-e-aza</p>
<p>Yeh nawha khwan yeh shair sabhi ki hai yeh sada</p>
<p>Ay khuda(j.j) ay khuda(j.j)</p>
<p>Hum rahay ya na rahay rahay baki yeh sada</p>
<p>(Gham-e-Hussain rahe, ye azadar rahe) x8</p></font></p>
